 This is the source code of [Fizzy](https://fizzy.do/), the Kanban tracking tool for issues and ideas by [37signals](https://37signals.com).
 
 
+## Self-hosting
+
+Run your own Fizzy on a single server with Kamal (SQLite, one container, HTTPS via `kamal-proxy`). See our [Deploying guide](docs/deploying.md): fill in your hostname, mail server, and secrets in `config/deploy.yml` / `.kamal/secrets`, then `bin/kamal setup`.
+
 ## Development
 
 You are welcome -- and encouraged -- to modify Fizzy to your liking.
